WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.960
In an alternative universe.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.879
I think Bibi would be a superhero.

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:05.922
She'd be able to fly.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.799
Maybe not well, because
her balance isn’t great.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:09.676
Maybe like reading people's minds?

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.846
She would be wearing something
definitely with a cape.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.222
And especially when she was flying.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:16.099
I think it would be quite beautiful.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.851
[Chuckles] Sorry.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.729
The color of her costume
would be a purple costume.

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:23.732
It's royal, it's regal,
and she's a bit of a queen.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:26.192
Her name would be Bad B*tch Bibi.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:31.281
I see Bibi fighting the male patriarchy.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:36.453
I think Ruben, her son,
would be an excellent sidekick.

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:40.957
He would charm his way out of
a lot of uncomfortable situations.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:46.004
But yes, I feel like they would be
a superhero fighting crime and men

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.881
dream team.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:51.760
If we were to put Grace
in an alternate reality,

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:56.473
I would have her as liberated
as she could possibly be.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:01:00.310
She would be madly in love with
the kindest, most gorgeous, generous man.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.562
And she would never be ashamed of herself.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.980
At the same time,

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.566
can you imagine if
she ran a huge charity?

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:09.235
Maybe she'd be like a
surprising eco warrior.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:12.405
She has this massive, big, empty hole
that needs to be filled

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.908
with people who have
a fire in their belly,

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.326
so that she gets one too.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:20.371
I think the Garvey girls
cannot live too far apart.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:22.082
There's a huge love magnet

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.708
That just summons them all together

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.418
In whatever universe,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.338
there will always be the invisible string
that keeps them together.

